@identityUrl = http://localhost:5106
@ordersUrl = http://localhost:5121
@restaurantId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@tableId = c270b467-98cc-47b2-b241-e45979659bf6
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@productId = f2de6d34-3665-4807-84f1-773ab16182da
@customerSessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@customerAccessToken = REEMPLAZAR_DESDE_DINING_QR

### Obtener JWT de camarero
# @name login
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "camarero1.mad-centro",
  "password": "Camarero-01-1-2026!"
}

### Crea datos: primero abra una sesion Dining y sustituya sessionId
# @name createOrder
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurantId}}",
  "tableId": "{{tableId}}",
  "diningSessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "tableLabel": "Mesa 01",
  "serviceMode": "DineIn",
  "source": "WaiterMobile",
  "paymentTiming": "OnAccount",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Prueba de Orders.Api.Write"
    }
  ]
}

### Enviar el pedido creado a cocina
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Iniciar la primera estacion
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/stations/{{createOrder.response.body.$.stations[0].code}}/start-preparation

### Marcar la primera estacion como lista
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/stations/{{createOrder.response.body.$.stations[0].code}}/ready

### Entregar el pedido cuando todas las estaciones esten listas
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}/deliver

### Crear pedido de cliente QR; la credencial viene de OpenQrSession en Dining
# @name createCustomerQrOrder
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders
X-Customer-Session-Token: {{customerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": "{{restaurantId}}",
  "tableId": "{{tableId}}",
  "diningSessionId": "{{customerSessionId}}",
  "tableLabel": "Mesa 01",
  "serviceMode": "DineIn",
  "source": "CustomerQr",
  "paymentTiming": "Immediate",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 1,
      "notes": "Pedido desde QR"
    }
  ]
}

### Enviar CustomerQr después de que Payments confirme el pago
POST {{ordersUrl}}/api/orders/{{createCustomerQrOrder.response.body.$.id}}/submit
X-Customer-Session-Token: {{customerAccessToken}}
